    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ps113">
        <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e98">Psalmus 113</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e104">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1034D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e108" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_1@1-1">Alleluia.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e111"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e112" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e115"><seg type="qs">Item hic alleluia ex alio negotio ponitur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut in psalmi expositione clarescit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e123">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e125" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_1@2-3">In exitu.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e128"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e129" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e132">Hic non narrantur praeterita; sed futura praedicuntur, quia in illis gestis futura signabantur: et ideo non omnia hic dicuntur, quae ibi gesta, sed quaedam aliter, ne putetur praeterita recolere.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e135">
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e137" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_1@2-3"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e139"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e140" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e143">Primo dicit Propheta, quae mira dederit Deus Hebraeis in figura, et Christianis in spiritu. Secundo interrogat quare haec facta sunt <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e145">ibi, <seg type="incipit">Quid est tibi mare</seg>?</ref> Tertio inania simulacra gentium reprobat, et religionem Dei commendat, <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e151">ibi, <seg type="incipit">Simulacra gentium</seg>.</ref></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e158">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e160" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_1@2-3">In exitu.</quote>
            Quasi cum Israel, id est, domus Jacob, de Aegypto, id est populo barbaro exiret.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e165">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1035A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e169" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_1@11-11">Barbaro.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e172"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e173" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e176">Barbaro lingua est, quae Deum non laudat.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e180">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e182">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e184">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e186" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_2@1-2">Facta est.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e189"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e190" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e193"><seg type="qs">Sicut ille populus, cum exiret de Aegypto</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">possunt resistere vitiis, et hoc.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e202">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e204">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e206">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e208" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_3">Vidit mare,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            id est, peccatores saeculi.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e214">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e216" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_3@6-6">Jordanis,</quote>
            qui variis desideriis rapiunt homines in magnum mare, id est, hujus saeculi amaricantem malitiam; sed haec in adventu Domini cessant, quasi conversa retrorsum.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e220">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e222" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_3@1-2">Mare vidit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e225"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e226" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e229">Hoc hic aliter dicitur, quam factum est. Ibi legitur stetisse ab ea parte, qua aquae desuper fluebant, nec ibi quidquam dicitur de gestientibus montibus, sed tam ibi facta quam hic dicta figurae sunt.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e233">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e235">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e237">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1035B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e241" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_4@4-4">Arietes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e244"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e245" ref="#Augustine">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e248"><seg type="qs">Qui cornibus utriusque</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">omnem scientiam adversus Christum se erigentem.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e256">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e258" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_4@6-6">Colles.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e261"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e262" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e265">A colendo, mediocres: non enim haec ad litteram; unde et per mare, et Jordanem, id est, per antiqua facta, haec signari non ambigas, quae hodie spiritualiter fiunt.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e270">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e272">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e274">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e276" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_5@1-3">Quid est tibi.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e279"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e280" ref="#Cassiodorus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e283">Secundo interrogat quare haec, ut excitet admirationem. Et solvit: <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e285" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_7@1-3">A facie Domini.</quote></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e290">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e292">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e294">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e296" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_7@1-2">A facie.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e299"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e300" ref="#Cassiodorus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e303">Una duobus responsio, quia unus auctor, et saecula fecit obstupescere, et sua, id est, montes et colles gaudere: Christo enim apparente moti sunt homines a sua superstitione ad cultum Dei.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e306">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e308" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_7@7-10">A facie Dei Jacob.</quote>
            Et quasi quaereret, quis est Dominus? <pb ed="#P" n="1035C"/> Deus Jacob non recens; qui facit eos luctari.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e315">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e317">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e319">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e321" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_8@1-3">Qui convertit petram.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e324"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e325" ref="#Cassiodorus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e328">Dura corda Judaeorum, ad aquam baptismi.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e331">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e333" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_8@8-8">Rupem.</quote>
            Gentiles, ut et ipsi emanent irriguos fontes praedicationis.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e337">
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e339" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_8@8-8"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e341"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e342" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e345"><seg type="qs">Id est, se prius durum, cum ignoraretur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">omnibus credentibus inundaret, dicens: <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e351" source="http://scta.info/resource/io7_37@12-19">Si quis sitit, veniat ad me, et bibat.</quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e356">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e358">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e360">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e362" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_1">Non nobis.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e367"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e368" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e371"><seg type="qs">Cum dixit Deum bona dare</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">veritas, dum praemia restituit, vel impios punit. Ideo, Da.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e380">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e382">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e384">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e386" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_2">Nequando:</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            hoc saepe impii imputant bonis afflictis.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e392">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e394" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_2">Misericordia.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e399"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e400" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e403">id est, reparatione.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e406">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e408" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_2">Veritate,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            id est, promissione impleta.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e414">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1035D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e418" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_2">Ubi est Deus.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e423"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e424" ref="#Augustine">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e427">Hoc solent dicere gentes, quae habent visibiles deos: quia invisibilem Deum colimus.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e431">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e433">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e435">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e437" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_3">In coelo.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e442"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e443" ref="#Augustine">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e446">id est, Christo homine, secundum illud: <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e448" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIcor5_19@3-9">Deus erat in Christo mundum sibi reconcilians.</quote> Vel, <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e451">in coelo,</quote> <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e453"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e454" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref><!-- check: attribution inside gloss body --> id est, potens super omnes creaturas.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e460">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e462" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_3">Omnia quaecunque voluit fecit.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Per quod omnipotens apparet.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e470">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e472">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e474">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e476" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_4">Simulacra gentium.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e481"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e482" ref="#Cassiodorus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e485">Tertio, inania simulacra probat, et religio Dei quam sit utilis ostendit. Et est hic perfecta demonstratio in vituperatione et laude.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e488">
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e490" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_4"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e492"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e493" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e496">Ostensa potentia veri Dei ex operibus, transit ad deos gentium visibiles.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e499">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e501" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_4">Argentum.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e506"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e507" ref="#Augustine">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e510">Sed quia Deus hoc fecit, inquit, <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e512" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_12@6-8">Opera <pb ed="#P" n="1036A"/> manuum hominum,</quote> hoc venerantur quod inde fecerunt, materiam enim creavit Deus; sed stultitia hominum formam addidit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e520">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e522">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e524">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e526" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_5">Os habent.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e531"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e532" ref="#Augustine">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e535"><seg type="qs">Manu sunt formata</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et servierunt creaturae potius quam creatori.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e544">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e546">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e548">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e550" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_7">Non clamabunt.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e555"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e556" ref="#Augustine">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e559"><seg type="qs">Post loqui (quod est hominis proprium) hoc commune addit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et carens vita sensuque simulacrum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e568">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e570">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e572">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e574" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_8">Similes illis.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e579"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e580" ref="#Augustine">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e583">Vide erubescibilem culturam, dum ait, <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e585">similes,</quote> quod vere sunt; vel similes se eis intelligant.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e590">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e592">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e594">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e596" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_9">Domus Israel.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e601"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e602" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e605">Hic ostendit Christianae religionis utilitatem.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e609">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e611">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e613">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e615" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_10">Domus Aaron.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e620"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e621" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e624">Ne autem videatur majoribus jam res, quae inferioribus est <pb ed="#P" n="1036B"/> spes, addit, <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e628">Domus Aaron.</quote></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e633">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e635">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e637">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e639" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_12">Memor.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e644"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e645" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e648">Ut converteret, et conversos per eumdem benedixit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e652">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e654">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e656">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e658" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_14">Super vos.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e663"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e664" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e667">Quia crevit numerus magistrorum.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e670">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e672" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_14">Super filios.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Quia crevit etiam numerus sequacium. Ergo vos utrique, patres et filii, benedicti estis Domino, qui vos fecit <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e677">coelum</quote> in majoribus, <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e679">et terram</quote> in minoribus; vel fecit omnem creaturam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e683">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e685">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e687">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e689" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_15">Benedicti vos a Domino.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e694"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e695" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e698">Qui optavit supra benedici, jam confisus dicit, <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e700">Benedicti,</quote> quod ad Deum pertinet, ut ei serviatis. Vere <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e702" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_17@5-5">Domino,</quote> quia etiam <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e705">coelum coeli,</quote> id est, Christus est ad honorem Domini; vel,</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e710">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e712">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e714">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e716" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_16">Coelum coeli,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            id est, empyreum, dedit <pb ed="#P" n="1036C"/> Domino Christo, secundum quod homo.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e724">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e726" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_16">Terram autem.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Istam inferiorem dedit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e732">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e734" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_16">Filiis hominum.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Ut in ea se purificent vel populum praedicatoribus; unde: Sicut misit me Pater, et ego mittam vos <!--<note>(Joan. VI)</note>-->.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e742">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e744" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_16">Coelum coeli.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e749"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e750" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e753"><seg type="qs">Dicit eos quorum mentes</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quem infirmi sine adminiculo adhuc videre non possunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ps113-Dd1e762">
          <head xml:id="gom-ps113-Hd1e764">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ps113-d1e766">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e768" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps113_17">Neque omnes qui descendunt.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-ps113-Rd1e773"><name xml:id="gom-ps113-Nd1e774" ref="#Cassiodorus">CASS.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ps113-Qd1e777">Vel non omnes qui descendunt; quia et sancti descenderunt, sed non in inferiori.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
</TEI>